Not covered by the MIT license

The Makrion character design belongs to its creator, a friend of the project.
The trained weights and neural textures (assets/), the rendered frames and the
checkpoints on the release page show that character. They are shared so the
project can be studied, run and retrained; please don't reuse the character
itself in other work without asking.

